      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1782373079577,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "How do we create objects\n========================\n\nTo create object firstly  we need to create class.\n\nclass is as datatype for an object.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "How do we create objects\n========================\n\nTo create object firstly  we need to create class.\n\nclass is as datatype for an object.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ejPY3ZEKWGTLzaL_TW0J2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 318,
      "y": 872.5,
      "width": 702,
      "height": 300,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a4",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 834619144,
      "version": 287,
      "versionNonce": 1083261192,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785170824860,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What is a class\n==============\n\n1. Class is a blueprint of an object, based on which java creates object.\n\n2. class is logical and object is physical.\n\nex - Plannet is class , Earth is Object.\n\n\nSyntax of creating class\n======================",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "What is a class\n==============\n\n1. Class is a blueprint of an object, based on which java creates object.\n\n2. class is logical and object is physical.\n\nex - Plannet is class , Earth is Object.\n\n\nSyntax of creating class\n======================",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "mvra8_H_KUjH3PKWnYTS-",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 319,
      "y": 1206.5,
      "width": 614,
      "height": 425,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
